      <title>美国CD收入激增58.6%：复古科技浪潮让实体唱片意外回暖</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BDCD%E6%94%B6%E5%85%A5%E6%BF%80%E5%A2%9E58.6%E5%A4%8D%E5%8F%A4%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E6%B5%AA%E6%BD%AE%E8%AE%A9%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E5%94%B1%E7%89%87%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%96%E5%9B%9E%E6%9A%96/</link>
